-- docs/adr/0001-template-output.md --
# ADR-1: Template Output

* **Status**: Accepted
* **Date**: 2026-10-21

<!-- semedit-adr-metadata:v1 keys=summary,description,role,scope,area,languages; do not change key names or order. -->
| Key | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| summary | Verify adr-tools generated numbering. |
| description | Normalize adr-tools' unpadded title number while retaining the canonical record identifier. |
| role | contract |
| scope | documentation |
| area | generic |
| languages | generic |

## Context

adr-tools pads the destination filename but writes the unpadded number into the title.

## Decision

Normalize the parsed identifier to four digits for the decision register and search results.

## Invariants

* The title number must match the record filename after normalization.

## Consequences

New records made from the repository template validate without post-editing the title.
